      "text": "lamb shall be without blemish, a male, Ex. 12:5 (Lev. 23:12). observe the feast of unleavened bread, Ex. 12:17 (23:15; 2 Chr. 30:13). take you a lamb … and kill the passover, Ex. 12:21. Lord will pass over the door, Ex. 12:23. This is the ordinance of the passover, Ex. 12:43. neither shall ye break a bone thereof, Ex. 12:46 (John 19:33). fourteenth day of the first month … the Lord’s passover, Lev. 23:5 (Num. 28:16; Josh. 5:10). keep the passover unto the Lord, Num. 9:14 (2 Kgs. 23:21–23). Thou shalt therefore sacrifice the passover, Deut. 16:2. children of the captivity kept the passover, Ezra 6:19.",
